  "body": "Vendors MUST SELL, emigrating!!\r\n \r\nPresent ALL Offers!\r\n\r\nOPEN HOME SUNDAY 1PM\r\n\r\nCV $1,350,000\r\n\r\nEnjoying Panoramic Sea Views and set in one of the most beautiful, peaceful, family-friendly suburbs in Auckland, this is a once in a lifetime opportunity to secure an incredible deal, and lifestyle, today\r\nProperty comes with a full moisture report from DryScan.\r\n\r\n290m2 Home on 1,188m2\r\nPerfectly positioned in one of Whangaparaoa's most sought after coastal enclaves, this substantial family residence captures stunning views across Okoromai Bay and beyond, offering an exceptional blend of space, privacy and relaxed seaside living\r\n\r\nSet across two levels and surrounded by established gardens, this thoughtfully designed home has been created to embrace its picturesque setting  Generous living spaces flow effortlessly to expansive sun-soaked decking, where panoramic water views provide a spectacular backdrop for entertaining, family gatherings or simply unwinding\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas are flooded with natural light, enhanced by soaring ceilings, extensive glazing and seamless indoor-outdoor connection. Multiple living zones provide flexibility for growing families, while the unique architectural design creates both character and functionality throughout\r\n\r\nAccommodation is well catered for with four spacious bedrooms and two and a half bathrooms, including a private upstairs master retreat complete with ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and its own balcony overlooking the bay. Additional bedrooms are generously proportioned and positioned to suit family living, guests or working from home\r\n\r\nOutside, the expansive wraparound deck becomes a true extension of the home, offering multiple spaces to relax, entertain and soak up the coastal surroundings. A spa pool, established landscaping and excellent privacy further enhance the lifestyle appeal and you're just moments from beaches, coastal walkways, Gulf Harbour Marina, schools and local amenities.\r\nMake an offer today!",
